---
import V2 from '../layouts/V2.astro';
---
<!-- blue-fish-404 -->
<V2 title="404 页面走丢了 - 蓝色大肥鱼" desc="蓝色大肥鱼的 404 页面：这个地址底下没有内容，可能是链接抄错、作品已下架或旧地址失效，可以回首页或按分类继续找。" path="/404.html" active="notfound" bodyPage="notfound" pageStyles={["/page-styles/404.css"]} robots="noindex,follow">
<div class="page">

    <h1 class="page-title" data-i18n="notfound.h1">404 · 这条鱼没找到</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="notfound.lede">这个地址底下是空的：链接可能抄错了，作品可能已经下架，也可能它压根还没收进来。</p>

    <div class="panel lost-card">
      <span class="tape-strip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="lost-code">404</p>
      <p class="lost-text" data-i18n="notfound.text">我翻遍了整个鱼塘，也没捞到你要的那张图。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lost-reasons">
      <h2 class="section-label" data-i18n="notfound.reasonsTitle">大概是这几种情况</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li><span data-i18n="notfound.reason1a">地址抄漏或抄错了一个字符——作品详情页的地址长这样：</span><span class="term">/works/作品slug.html</span><span data-i18n="notfound.reason1c">。</span></li>
        <li data-i18n="notfound.reason2">这张作品被作者要求下架了，已经从站上撤掉。</li>
        <li data-i18n="notfound.reason3">你点的是改版前的旧地址，页面换了位置；首页、分类和更新日志都还在。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lost-exits">
      <a class="btn primary hover-wiggle" href="/index.html">
        <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 7 8 2.5 13.5 7" /><path d="M3.75 6.5V13.5H12.25V6.5" /></svg>
        <span data-i18n="notfound.exitHome">回首页看看</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="/category.html">
        <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 4.5h11M2.5 8h11M2.5 11.5h7" /></svg>
        <span data-i18n="notfound.exitCategory">按角色或分类翻</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="/submit.html" data-i18n="notfound.exitSubmit">手上有图，顺便投一张</a>
    </div>

    <p class="note"><span data-i18n="notfound.noteA">如果这个地址是从站内点进来的，那就是我挂错了，欢迎到 </span><a href="https://github.com/lmy414/ai-girl-stickers/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Issues</a><span data-i18n="notfound.noteC"> 说一声。</span></p>

</div>
</V2>
